## 6. 状态管理（Zustand）

### 6.1 sceneStore

```typescript
interface SceneState {
  document: SceneDocument;
  selectedIds: string[];
  placementAssetId: string | null;

  // actions
  setPlacementAsset: (assetId: string | null) => void;
  addModel: (assetId: string, position: Vec3) => void;
  updateTransform: (id: string, transform: Partial<Transform>) => void;
  updateEntity: (id: string, patch: Partial<SceneEntity>) => void;
  updateSettings: (patch: Partial<SceneSettings>) => void;
  setSelection: (ids: string[]) => void;
  removeSelected: () => void;
  groupSelected: () => void;
  ungroupSelected: () => void;
  clearScene: () => void;
  loadDocument: (doc: SceneDocument) => void;
  getEntityWorldTransform: (id: string) => Transform;
}
```

### 6.2 historyStore

```typescript
interface HistoryState {
  past: Command[];
  future: Command[];
  execute: (cmd: Command) => void;
  undo: () => void;
  redo: () => void;
  clear: () => void;
  canUndo: boolean;
  canRedo: boolean;
}
```

### 6.3 Command 接口

```typescript
interface Command {
  name: string;
  execute: () => void;
  undo: () => void;
}
```

**P0 需实现的 Command**：

| Command | 触发场景 |
|---------|----------|
| `AddEntityCommand` | 放置模型 |
| `RemoveEntitiesCommand` | 删除 |
| `UpdateTransformCommand` | Gizmo 拖拽结束 |
| `UpdateEntityCommand` | 属性面板改字段 |
| `GroupCommand` / `UngroupCommand` | 组合/解组 |
| `UpdateSettingsCommand` | 场景属性变更 |
| `ClearSceneCommand` | 清空 |
| `LoadDocumentCommand` | 加载方案（可选，undo 栈清空） |

**实现要点**：`execute` 与 `undo` 必须对称；Transform 拖拽只在 **pointerup** 时入栈一次，避免每一帧一条历史。

